            "body": "Haven't thought about it. The fake visual selections are an implementation detail; promoting them to an exposed interface will require care. \n\nIt is a compelling idea, it would bring sublime/vis \"multiselect\" concept to Nvim. But that needs to wait until later. `zq` + `gv` is the current approximation of \"multiselect\", but it also needs more thought.",
