        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ah, I misunderstood this as a bug and had already worked on an implementation with AI assistance before seeing your comments 😅\n\nI’ve pushed it to [my fork](https://github.com/masterj122517/neovim/commit/9f7d2c4f0f325561ef89f966b9729f4e4cda07fd) rather than opening a PR. It lets plugins add and update selections through this namespace, and keeps the cursors after leaving Visual mode.\n\nI get that the interface hasn’t been decided yet. Just leaving the code here in case any of it is useful later.",
